	"descriptionMarkdown": "### Mid-game ore → molten metal smelting\n\nA compact mid-game Foundry smelting set: takes fully stacked green belts of ore and outputs molten iron / molten copper via pipes. Fully consume the stated belts.\n\n#### Blueprint book contents (3 blueprints)\n\n- 2 stacked green belts iron ore → molten iron\n- 2 stacked green belts copper ore → molten copper\n- 8 stacked green belts iron ore + 8 stacked green belts copper ore → molten iron + molten copper\n\n#### Tech Level\n* Foundries, level 3 speed modules + level 3 productivity modules \n* Normal quality items\n\n#### I/O and usage notes\n\n* Inputs: stacked green belts of ore + calcite\n* Outputs: pipes only (no buffer tanks)\n* Byproducts: none\n* Intended use: practical mid-game molten production for Nauvis and Gleba, where ore supply is abundant.\n\n#### Getting started\n\n* Connect the ore belt inputs.\n* Provide calcite.\n",
